{"about_the_game":"<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/zap_banner_anim.gif?t=1752574606\" /></div><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Route-planning meets tower-defense. A minimalist, real-time strategy sim where colour-matched power-lines feed ever-hungry turrets. Route the power. Zap the Starclops. Protect the colony.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Zap Colony\u26a1</strong> challenges you to design and optimize a colony defense network on a distant planet. The game takes place on a grid-based map, with colony buildings and alien hives spawning outside of your control. Your job is to defend the colony from different colored Starclops by strategically placing turrets, upgrading and connecting them to a power source of matching color. Sounds easy? Success is measured by how long you can withstand before the colony is overrun.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key features</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/sc_green.png?t=1752574606\" /></div> <strong>Real-time</strong> growing colony <strong>simulation</strong> with time controls and <strong>active pause</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/sc_green.png?t=1752574606\" /></div> Build power-lines at your own pace and rearrange resources on the fly<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/sc_green.png?t=1752574606\" /></div> Place and upgrade defense towers to zap more starclops with a single shot<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440510/extras/sc_green.png?t=1752574606\" /></div> Upgrade power statio